V4 HiZ, compute and raster integration
-------------------------------------
- vk/gpu/{HizLayout.java,HizImage.java,HizBlitPipeline.java,HizPyramid.java}
  <- client/core/rendering/util/{HiZBuffer2.java,HiZBuffer.java} and the HiZ
  shaders listed above: R32F allocation, floor-power-of-two extents, depth blit,
  compute mip chain, small-extent blit schedule and sampling conventions.
- compute/{LodComputeLayout.java,LodComputeExecutor.java}
  <- client/core/rendering/hierachical/{HierarchicalOcclusionTraverser.java,NodeCleaner.java},
  client/core/rendering/section/backend/mdic/MDICSectionRenderer.java and
  client/core/rendering/Viewport.java: ping-pong traversal, cleaner passes,
  scene arithmetic and prep/cull/cmdgen/prefix-sum/translucent pass ordering.
- vk/render/{VulkanLodPipeline.java,VulkanLodRenderer.java,LodCullRasterPass.java}
  <- client/core/rendering/section/backend/mdic/MDICSectionRenderer.java and
  lod/gl46 shaders: indexed-indirect ranges, raster state and section-AABB
  visibility pass semantics, adapted to the borrowed game Vulkan device.
- vk/render/LodIndexBuffer.java <- client/core/rendering/util/SharedIndexBuffer.java:
  shared quad winding and AABB cube indices; Vulkan stores cube indices as
  UINT16 rather than upstream GL_UNSIGNED_BYTE.
- vk/render/LodFrameMath.java <- client/core/rendering/hierachical/NodeCleaner.java:
  free-geometry cleaner threshold.
- vk/render/LodSamplers.java <- client/core/model/ModelStore.java:
  nearest atlas texels, linear mip interpolation and repeat addressing.
- vk/render/LodDepthConvertPass.java replaces the role of the upstream depth
  copy/one-frame-latent HiZ input; its Vulkan projection conversion, resources
  and barriers are new implementation rather than a GL command translation.

V4 model bakery and atlas
-------------------------
Upstream model paths in this section are under client/core/model/.
- model/{ModelFactory.java,ModelRecordEncoder.java,ModelColourTable.java,ModelTinting.java,ModelIdTable.java,ModelSignature.java}
  <- ModelFactory.java: model/fluid ordering, face analysis and metadata,
  tint capture and biome LUT rebasing, dense model IDs and baked-face deduplication.
  ModelSignature replaces the upstream full-array equality key with a canonical
  SHA-256 digest; this is an adaptation, not the original equality implementation.
- model/ColourDepthTextureData.java <- ColourDepthTextureData.java:
  face colour/depth data and content equality/hash semantics.
- model/ModelQueries.java <- ModelQueries.java: per-face/global metadata bits.
- model/TextureUtils.java <- TextureUtils.java: coverage, bounds, depth, tint,
  mip filtering and linear-space averaging.
- model/MipGen.java <- MipGen.java: six-face packing, transparent-pixel
  solidification and mip chain generation.
- model/{ModelAtlasLayout.java,VulkanModelAtlas.java,ModelResources.java}
  <- ModelFactory.java, ModelStore.java, MipGen.java and lod/block_model.glsl /
  lod/gl46/quads.frag: 16-bit IDs, 3x2 face tiles, 256x256 tile grid, four mip
  levels (0–3), model/colour buffer and atlas sampling contracts.
- model/ModelGeometryBaker.java <- bakery/SoftwareModelTextureBakery.java:
  directional/unculled quads, six view transforms, fluid tessellation and ordering.
- model/BakeVertexConsumer.java <- bakery/ReuseVertexConsumer.java:
  vertex/meta encoding and quad triangle order.
- model/VulkanModelBaker.java and shaders/model/{bake.vert,bake.frag}
  <- bakery/{SoftwareModelTextureBakery.java,SoftwareRasterizer.java}:
  six-view projection, face winding, opaque/translucent blending, tint/stencil
  and colour/depth result semantics. Vulkan rasterization/readback replaces the
  upstream GL/software raster path; the shaders are Vulkan-specific implementations.
- model/{ModelProvider.java,ModelStateSource.java} and
  data/BlockStateModelIdResolver.java expose/adapt ModelFactory.java,
  ModelBakerySubsystem.java and common/world/other/Mapper.java provider and
  block-state/model-ID domain contracts; upstream IdNotYetComputedException.java
  is a behavioral reference for the unresolved-ID case, not a copied local file.
  model/ModelLifecycle.java is project Fabric resource-reload integration.
- vk/bridge/mixin/{SpriteContentsAccessor.java,StairBlockAccessor.java}
  replace the upstream access-widener access to SpriteContents.mipmapStrategy
  and StairBlock.baseState used by the model bakery/tint logic.

